					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272632,
					"content": "直到有一天…他在近月帶接收到了一個…來自星空深處的神秘訊號…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272633
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272633,
					"content": "星空深處的訊號？那是什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272634
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272634,
					"content": "學者們沒能解讀訊號的含義…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272635
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272635,
					"content": "但那位先驅認為…那是他們前往星海的王…傳回的訊息…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272636
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272636,
					"content": "王的名字是…「尼伯龍根」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272637
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272637,
					"content": "是…是那位龍王？！真的是他傳回來的訊號嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272638
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272638,
					"content": "不知道…因為學者們無法進入深空…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272639
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272639,
					"content": "所以…他們建設了這座高塔…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272640
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272640,
					"content": "這座「伊比尼伯龍之眼」…最初其實是一座深空訊號收發站…為了再次捕捉那個訊號…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272641
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272641,
					"content": "那後來他們成功了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272642
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761272642,
					"content": "後來…過去了很多年…直到那位先驅離世…訊號都沒有再出現…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272643
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272643,
					"content": "再後來…他的學生也放棄了…轉去了更加務實的方向。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272644
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272644,
					"content": "他們將「伊比尼伯龍之眼」改造成月球表面監測站…方便他們進行更實際的月球研究工作…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272645
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272645,
					"content": "好遺憾啊…感覺我們知道了很不得了的事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272646
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272646,
					"content": "這就是「望月者計畫」嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272647
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761272647,
					"content": "不…這些只是我讀取到的日誌資訊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272648
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272648,
					"content": "真正的「望月者計畫」被加密了…我無法打開…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272649
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272649,
					"content": "咦？你剛才不是說它在回應你嗎？那不是應該能直接打開嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272650
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272650,
					"content": "我的資訊與它相符…但也許因為…數量還不夠…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272651
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272651,
					"content": "什麼叫數量還不夠？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272652
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272652,
					"content": "就像是…零食與派蒙相符…但是兩成的零食不夠派蒙吃。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272653
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272653,
					"content": "兩成是你的，我有八成！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272654
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272654,
					"content": "聽起來黑蛋像是一個鑰匙模具。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272655
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761272655,
					"content": "缺少了內容物，所以打造不出鑰匙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272656
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761272656,
					"content": "欸？好像感覺就是這個意思！這麼想的話，這個「望月者計畫」會不會跟黑蛋的使命有關呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272657
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272657,
					"content": "它居然主動回應黑蛋的訊息，感覺就像是等著她來呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272658
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272658,
					"content": "我不知道…但我想…打開它…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272659
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272659,
					"content": "那我們來幫忙吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272660
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272660,
					"content": "既然是資訊的數量不夠，那我們去找更多終端機就好了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272661
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272661,
					"content": "剛才我就發現了，黑蛋每吸收一座終端機，說話就更流利一些，個性也更自滿一些。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272662
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272662,
					"content": "雖然我不喜歡這樣的變化，但如果和她的使命有關，我也只能支持她了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272663,
						761272664
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272663,
					"content": "哇，是細心派蒙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272665
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761272665,
					"content": "哼哼，畢竟黑蛋也有幫我們找哥倫比婭嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272666
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272666,
					"content": "你放心吧，黑蛋，既然這裡有終端機，前面一定也有！跟我們走，總會把你餵飽的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272667
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272667,
					"content": "謝謝…派蒙…那我會盡力…不變自滿…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272668
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272668,
					"content": "嘿嘿，那我們現在該去下一站了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272669
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272669,
					"content": "出發吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272670
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761272670,
					"content": "好耶！月球大冒險第二站——「烏吉烏吉圈」！出發！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272671
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272671,
					"content": "…是「烏吉恩圈」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272672
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272672,
					"content": "「烏吉烏吉圈」！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761272664,
					"content": "哇，是大方派蒙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761272665
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
}